                  "text": "Stretching along the scenic coastal edge of Kampor, Plaža Mel is a wonderful spot for a classic Adriatic beach day. The environment feels open and welcoming, drawing in visitors eager to sunbathe or simply stroll by the rippling waves. Taking a refreshing swim here is the perfect way to cool down during a warm summer afternoon. Arriving a bit earlier ensures you find the best spot on the shore for a long, lazy day."
