                  "text": "Combining soft sand and smooth pebbles, this charming shallow beach is a standout destination near Crveni Vrh in the village of Zambratija. Its exceptionally gentle slope into the sea creates a wonderfully family-friendly atmosphere where children can splash safely. It is an excellent spot for long, carefree days of sunbathing and building sandcastles by the calm waters. Packing some water shoes is a good idea to navigate the mixed terrain comfortably.",
